# Loaded by `next build` for the production site. Committed on purpose: every
# value here is public, since NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the static export.
# Secrets (GITHUB_TOKEN, anything without the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) never go
# here; they stay in the host's build environment. A value set in the host's
# environment overrides this file.

# Streamable-HTTP endpoint of the docs MCP server (tetherto/qvac-docs-search),
# shown by the "Add to your AI tool" button under the sidebar search. Unset,
# the button does not render. Use a stable hostname and include the /mcp path:
# every install already handed out breaks if this URL changes. The site has to
# be rebuilt for a change to take effect. See .env.example for details.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MCP_URL=https://mcp.pears.com/mcp
